      en: ["The airport is located 19 kilometers east of Benghazi city center.", "It was used as a base by the Italian Air Force during World War II.", "The facility was closed for three years due to conflict from 2014 to 2017.", "It officially resumed commercial operations in mid-2017.", "Benina is Libya's second largest airport by passenger traffic.", "Major international routes include flights to Istanbul, Cairo, and Tunis."],
