      en: ["The lighthouse was constructed by Italian authorities in 1922.", "It is located in the Sidi Khrebeish area near the old city center.", "The tower stands at a height of 22 meters (72 feet).", "It features a traditional black and white striped exterior pattern.", "The site overlaps with the ancient Greek city of Berenice.", "It survived heavy shelling during the Battle of Benghazi in 2014-2017."],
