      en: ["The lighthouse serves as the primary navigation point for the port of Al Khums.", "It is located approximately 3 kilometers west of the ancient city of Leptis Magna.", "The current structure was significantly renovated and automated during the 20th century.", "Al Khums is a major hub for the export of limestone and cement products.", "The tower features distinctive red and white markings for daytime visibility.", "Its light signal has a range of over 18 nautical miles in clear weather conditions."],
      es: ["Un faro distintivo en el puerto de Al Khums que guía la navegación en la costa histórica.", "Se encuentra en el territorio del estado de Libia en el norte de África.", "Juega un papel en la identidad local de la región.", "Conocido por su importancia paisajística o cultural."],
